{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117455","id":3401723886,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Kwi_u","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117455","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117455.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117455.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117455","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117455/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117455/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117455/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/08a7945348a12d87b21c8a407c117faf213e20a7","number":117455,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Use `VariantInitializer` to initialize temporaries","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using this script</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar iter : int = 1_000_000\r\nvar test_strick : float = 0.0\r\nvar time : float = 0.0\r\n\r\nfunc add10(p0: int, p1: int, p2: int, p3: int, p4: int, p5: int, p6: int, p7: int, p8: int, p9: int) -> int:\r\n\treturn p0 + p1 + p2 + p3 + p4 + p5 + p6 + p7 + p8 + p9\r\n\r\nfunc add2(p0: int, p2: int) -> int:\r\n\treturn p0 + p2\r\n\r\nfunc noarg() -> int:\r\n\treturn v0\r\n\r\nvar v0 := 0\r\nvar v1 := 1\r\nvar v2 := 2\r\nvar v3 := 3\r\nvar v4 := 4\r\nvar v5 := 5\r\nvar v6 := 6\r\nvar v7 := 7\r\nvar v8 := 8\r\nvar v9 := 9\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tfor ii in range(1):\r\n\t\tvar sum: int\r\n\t\tvar func_10_t: float\r\n\t\tvar in_10_t: float\r\n\t\tvar func_2_t: float\r\n\t\tvar in_2_t: float\r\n\t\tvar func_no_t: float\r\n\t\tvar in_no_t: float\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += add10(v0, v1, v2, v3, v4, v5, v6, v7, v8, v9)\r\n\t\tfunc_10_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += v0 + v1 + v2 + v3 + v4 + v5 + v6 + v7 + v8 + v9\r\n\t\tin_10_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += add2(v1, v2)\r\n\t\tfunc_2_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += v1 + v2\r\n\t\tin_2_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += noarg()\r\n\t\tfunc_no_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\ttime = Time.get_unix_time_from_system()\r\n\t\tfor i:int in range(iter):\r\n\t\t\tsum += v0\r\n\t\tin_no_t = Time.get_unix_time_from_system() - time\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tprint(\"Args, Function, Inline, Overhead\")\r\n\t\tprint(10, \", \", func_10_t, \", \", in_10_t, \", \", func_10_t - in_10_t)\r\n\t\tprint(2, \", \", func_2_t, \", \", in_2_t, \", \", func_2_t - in_2_t)\r\n\t\tprint(0, \", \", func_no_t, \", \", in_no_t, \", \", func_no_t - in_no_t)\r\n\t\t\r\n\tget_tree().quit()\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nIn a debug build for a function with 10 temporaries I'm seeing around a 5% decrease in call overhead. Due to high variance I can not reliably benchmark this against a production build.\r\n\r\nAlso this is kinda a black box optimization for me, since I have no understanding of how `memnew_placement` works, I can not really say why it is slower.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-15T21:02:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T09:28:17Z","closed_at":"2026-03-20T09:09:31Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"86cb95bc2b808d33bb0ee968d40140d71bbdd929","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HolonProduction:gdscript/variant-init","ref":"gdscr